OL,3,GNEWSACall to limit length of speeches
OL,4,Ain tax debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's only registered political
OL,7,Fparty will attempt to limit the length
OL,8,Fof speeches at this week's debate on
OL,9,Ftax reform.
OL,11,FForward Guernsey want to make it so
OL,12,Fdeputies have five minutes for most
OL,13,Fspeeches and up to seven-and-a-half
OL,14,Fminutes for closing speeches, rather
OL,15,Fthan 15 minutes.
OL,17,FIn July deputies started debating
OL,18,FPolicy and Resources' tax reform
OL,19,Fpackage, centred on a 3% GST, but ran
OL,20,Fout of time - when the debate resumes
OL,21,Fon Wednesday there will be 40
OL,22,Famendments to get through.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
