OL,3,GNEWSACall to limit length of speeches
OL,4,Ain tax debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf they do not finish the debate at
OL,7,Fthis meeting business will roll over to
OL,8,F21 October, with some officials
OL,9,Fconcerned a later decision on the tax
OL,10,Fpackage could lead to a delay
OL,11,Fintroducing it.
